WEBVTT

00:13:29.346 --> 00:13:31.678
contorted, or taken away.

00:13:31.702 --> 00:13:35.776
The light never goes out.

00:13:35.800 --> 00:13:37.886
As a very wonderful
doctor once said to me,

00:13:37.910 --> 00:13:41.137
"Don't tell me what other people
have told you about yourself.

00:13:41.161 --> 00:13:44.188
Tell me about you."

00:13:44.212 --> 00:13:45.994
Thank you.

00:13:46.018 --> 00:13:51.542
(Applause)